Z||000003||jelly2m8||10-01-2001||08:07 PM|||| I personally hope GM never brings back the Fiero. You just know it would not be a Fiero anywhere near of what we are used to.<P> I think this is one of the things that make Fieros special, A Fiero is basically a Fiero,no matter what year it is, no different generations, no different platforms ( well the 88 kinda is, but you get the point). If they bring back the Fiero, then it would just be like a F-body, or a vette, an ordinary car. <P> Personally other than the 89 fastback prototype pictures, the 89 coupe pics look like ass. But thats my opinion, and I am glad they didnt produce Fieros looking like that.||||reg||1
