Z||000005||grgoyl86||10-01-2001||09:25 PM||||Speaking of a bad move bringing back a car name - Does everyone remember the original Pontiac LeMans? Then, the new LeMans in the late 80s? Oh my god!<P>Another funny story on the new LeMans. When the announcement cam out about diccontinuing the Fiero, a Pontiac official was quoted as saying that people who would have bought  Fieros in 89 and beyond would buy the LeMans instead. Right!<P>||||reg||9
