Z||000007||Fformula88||10-01-2001||09:33 PM||||The Fiero could be brought back in an appealing form too (i.e. the Opel Speedster would do justice to the Fiero name IMO).  It all depends on how it was done and what the final product would be.  They still know how to make nice cars too... the Corvette seems to get better and better (Z06!) and despite the controversial styling the new Evoq sounds like its going to be a really good performer!  <P>Don't count the Impala out yet.  Lots of rumors are circulating about a V8 Impala SS showing up in the near future.  Yeah, still would be FWD but thats not the end of the world.  The last Impala was fast, but the Caprice platform wasn't any great shakes either.  ||||reg||1
