Z||000021||WKDFIRO||10-02-2001||08:57 PM||||From the last that I heard the Opel Speedster is NOT coming to America. At least not any time soon. <BR>I am in agreement that I would be hesitant for GM to try a new iteration on the Fiero given what they have done to the Le Mans (A Korean built car, in America, with a French name???)and to the Impalas (I just have to shake my head when I see them...). <P>It would have been the kick in the butt GM needed if Bob Lutz had joined them. (I hadn't heard he was staying with Exide. GMs loss.) You just don't have many Bob Lutz clones around. CAR GUYS in charge of CAR companies.||||reg||8
